OL,3,GNEWSATicketmaster accused of misleading
OL,4,AOasis fans
OL,5,
OL,6,FTicketmaster has been accused of
OL,7,Fbreaching consumer law over the sale of
OL,8,FOasis tickets for their Dublin gigs.
OL,10,FThe Competition and Consumer Protection
OL,11,FCommission (CCPC) accused Ticketmaster
OL,12,Fof providing prices for tickets in a
OL,13,Fway that was unclear and offering
OL,14,Fplatinum tickets in a way that would
OL,15,Fcause customers to be misled.
OL,17,FOasis performed in Croke Park on 16
OL,18,FAugust and 17 August 2025 as part of
OL,19,Ftheir wider reunion tour.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
