OL,3,GNEWSATicketmaster accused of misleading
OL,4,AOasis fans
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 900,000 tickets were sold for
OL,7,FOasis's long-awaited reunion tour when
OL,8,Fthey went on sale on 31 August 2024,
OL,9,Fbut many fans complained about what
OL,10,Fthey labelled unclear pricing.
